ks disagree."],["P",{},"Recorded final assessment: ","The requested information is supported by the provided citations. The Fetch Standard’s tests are kept in the `fetch/` directory of `web-platform-tests/wpt`, and a dashboard showing the tests running against browser engines can be accessed ["]],["UL",{},["LI",{},["BLOCKQUOTE",{},"“","Tests for the Fetch Standard can be found in the `fetch/` directory of [`web-platform-tests/wpt`](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt).","”"],["SMALL",{},"[","source-1","] text ","1914","–","2055"," · snapshot ","d6f9a63d-e55b-4079-b7b3-a541ad9f2176"," · text SHA-256 ","d484144421db3f758ef98fe5bf13c3dbe1e07a357033af5288298ea0f4f2ceaa"]],["LI",{},["BLOCKQUOTE",{},"“","A dashboard showing the tests running against browser engines can be seen at [wpt.fyi/results/fetch](https://wpt.fyi/results/fetch).","”"],["SMALL",{},"[","source-1","] text ","2057","–","2189"," · snapshot ","d6f9a63d-e55b-4079-b7b3-a541ad9f2176"," · text SHA-256 ","d484144421db3f758ef98fe5bf13c3dbe1e07a357033af5288298ea0f4f2ceaa"]]],["P",{},"The model selected citation span IDs; the host copied their exact saved text. This checks text identity, not independent factual answer accuracy."]],["DIV",{"class":"goal-source-followup"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button"},"Ask another question from saved sources"],["SMALL",{},"Prepare a new question using these verified saved copies without fetching them again. The original question and answer stay unchanged. Nothing is submitted until you send the new question."]]],["OL",{"class":"goal-milestones"},["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"1",". ","Save public source 1 for this question."],["P",{},"Accepted"," · ","research"],["DETAILS",{},["SUMMARY",{},"Acceptance and evidence"],["P",{},"Persist the bounded response and full extracted text with URL, title, retrieval time and matching byte/text SHA-256. Acquisition only; no factual claim."],["P",{},"Public response and full extracted text saved. Acquisition identity only; no answer or factual verifi