{"type":"after","callId":"qznh@2186","endTime":48485.081,"result":{"value":"Fetch test contributor brief\nBrief\n\nThe Fetch Standard’s tests are kept in the fetch/ directory of web-platform-tests/wpt and can be seen at https://wpt.fyi/results/fetch. [1] [2]\n\nExact source question\n\nWhere are the Fetch Standard’s tests kept, and where can I see them running against browser engines? Cite the README statements supporting both.\n\nYour note — supplied by you, not a source claim\n\nCheck the live dashboard before filing a browser bug. This is my personal next step, not a claim from the source.\n\nReference [1] · Literal saved-source quote (source-1, text 1914–2055): Tests for the Fetch Standard can be found in the `fetch/` directory of [`web-platform-tests/wpt`](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt).\n\nReference [2] · Literal saved-source quote (source-1, text 2057–2189): A dashboard showing the tests running against browser engines can be seen at [wpt.fyi/results/fetch](https://wpt.fyi/results/fetch).\n\nSaved source source-1\n\nREADME.md\n\nURL: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/whatwg/fetch/main/README.md\n\nRetrieved: 2026-10-29T21:58:02.278Z\n\nSnapshot: a17c0dbc-6f49-4370-b7c1-f95037ca0eea\n\nResponse SHA-256: d484144421db3f758ef98fe5bf13c3dbe1e07a357033af5288298ea0f4f2ceaa\n\nText SHA-256: d484144421db3f758ef98fe5bf13c3dbe1e07a357033af5288298ea0f4f2ceaa\n\nScope and provenance\n\nThe model selected citation span IDs; the host copied their exact saved text. This checks text identity, not independent factual answer accuracy.\n\nWritten by the local model from the accepted answer and selected saved passages. Fixed host code rendered this document. Source claims and general factual accuracy were not independently verified.\n\nParent question: ac3780e2-30dd-4e40-a779-25173bfa4e99\n\nBrief goal: df6fb28a-0334-41c6-8e09-31f7b3dafd2b"}}
